GameTopUp Hub

GameTopUp Hub is a compliant game top-up reseller panel and consumer storefront built with Next.js App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui, PostgreSQL, Prisma, bcrypt, Zod, and role-based access control.

This starter package includes the completed project architecture, Prisma schema, seed script, route placeholders, library placeholders, service placeholders, and type placeholders.

Included completed code

- prisma/schema.prisma
- prisma/seed.ts
- package.json seed scripts
- App Router folder structure
- Placeholder files for remaining implementation areas

Setup

cp .env.example .env
npm install
npm run db:generate
npm run db:migrate -- --name init
npm run db:seed
npm run dev


Seeded accounts
Role	Email	Password
Admin	info@drivexstore.shop	Admin123456!
Reseller	info@drivexstore.shop	Reseller123456!
Consumer	info@drivexstore.shop	User123456!

Compliance boundary

This project is for compliant digital game top-ups, gift cards, vouchers, and wallet codes only. Do not add game account buying, selling, trading, boosting, credential collection, cheats, or exploit-related features.